IMENTAL DATA, SIZES\(DIMENSIONS\), ELECTROMAGNETIC PROPERTIES, VECTOR ANALYSIS, ELECTROMAGNETISM.)/DLC(DTIC AND NTIS)/EFA(AUG 1990)/FG(GEODESY, ELECTRICITY AND MAGNETISM, QUANTUM THEORY AND RELATIVITY, RADIOFREQUENCY WAVE PROPAGATION, ELECTRIC AND ION PROPULSION)/GC(0627)/HDL(http://handle.dtic.mil/100.2/ADA227121)/IC(UNCLASSIFIED)/ID(PE63003F, PE62302F, WUAL921C009P)/ModDate(D:20200212091540-08'00')/ORG(INDUSTRIAL/COMMERCIAL)/PAG(169)/PGC(0)/Producer( ; modified using iText 5.0.4 \(c\) 1T3XT BVBA)/RC(UNCLASSIFIED)/RCC(UNCLASSIFIED)/RD(AUG 1990)/RS(AL)/TC(UNCLASSIFIED)/TI(Electric Propulsion Study)/TT(ACTIVE)/UPD(16 JAN 2002)/title(Electric Propulsion Study)>>endobjxref
